Package: wakehub
Version: __VERSION__
Depends: ca-bundle
Section: net
Category: Network
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: WakeHub maintainers
Source: https://github.com/leganck/wakehub
Description: WakeHub LAN power hub server (WOL + Bemfa MQTT + client WS).
 Manage devices via the built-in Web UI; enable/configure globals via LuCI
 (luci-app-wakehub) or /etc/config/wakehub.
